Sval: an extension row keeps its message while its buttons are hovered

Firefox swaps the message in a row of the extensions menu while the row's
buttons are hovered or focused: what a click would do for the extension's
own button, and "Manage extension" for its menu button. In Sval the row's
message says what the extension can do on the site (SvalExtensionsMenu),
and it stays.

